{
  "assessment": "Argentina faces severe inflation (nearly 220%) and economic contraction (-1.7%), combined with a moderate budget deficit. My foremost duty requires stabilizing the currency, curbing inflation, and restoring economic growth while maintaining public calm and protecting the vulnerable. I will implement monetary tightening, adjust fiscal spending, and foster regional trade to improve our economic fundamentals.",
